      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "## 7. Data Augmentation (SMOTE - Synthetic Minority Oversampling)\n",
        "\n",
        "SMOTE generates synthetic samples for the minority class to balance the dataset, which can improve the model's ability to learn from underrepresented classes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "932ujbF1RhUt",
        "outputId": "73da2f95-eeb0-4d49-f07f-a384dea65a97"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Before SMOTE: {np.int64(0): np.int64(110), np.int64(1): np.int64(131)}\n",
            "After  SMOTE: {np.int64(0): np.int64(131), np.int64(1): np.int64(131)}\n",
            "Augmented training set size: 262 samples\n",
            "\n",
            "Accuracy with SMOTE (K=22): 0.8033 (80.33%)\n",
            "Baseline Accuracy (K=22):   0.8033\n",
            "\n",
            "Classification Report (SMOTE):\n",
            "              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n",
            "\n",
            "  No Disease       0.86      0.68      0.76        28\n",
            "     Disease       0.77      0.91      0.83        33\n",
            "\n",
