        "---\n",
        "## 8. Advanced Hyperparameter Tuning (GridSearchCV)\n",
        "\n",
        "Tuning multiple hyperparameters simultaneously:\n",
        "- **n_neighbors**: Number of neighbors (K)\n",
        "- **weights**: Uniform vs distance-weighted voting\n",
        "- **metric**: Euclidean, Manhattan, Minkowski distances\n",
        "- **p**: Power parameter for Minkowski distance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "YOTvBVCBRhUu",
        "outputId": "c382aa27-898f-4a5e-fce0-a3ad7cfdc013"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Fitting 10 folds for each of 450 candidates, totalling 4500 fits\n",
            "\n",
            "Best Parameters: {'metric': 'manhattan', 'n_neighbors': 21, 'p': 1, 'weights': 'uniform'}\n",
            "Best CV Accuracy: 0.8462 (84.62%)\n",
            "Test Accuracy  : 0.7705 (77.05%)\n",
            "\n",
            "Classification Report (Best Model):\n",
            "              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n",
